00:55:40.040 --> 00:55:44.080
bubble and their proprioception of how you&nbsp;
get into their awareness of their space,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:44.080 --> 00:55:48.480
it's kind of shaped like an egg. And it's larger&nbsp;
