01:36:59.360 --> 01:37:03.200
and then I walk over while this other lady, Lisa,&nbsp;
is talking to these people. I open her purse,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:37:03.200 --> 01:37:07.467
drop it in there, put it there, and then I&nbsp;
go back to where I was. He doesn't know this.&nbsp;

01:37:07.467 --> 01:37:09.800
Tim Ferriss: So it was the right Lisa.
