any of your horseshit. We need to have a talk."
Apollo Robbins: It'd be easier to have game on,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:37:56.160 --> 01:38:01.240
game off. I think we don't. We do use it&nbsp;
in our social interactions with each other,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:38:01.240 --> 01:38:05.840
as well. But she does it, too. Her career&nbsp;
path, she became a mentalist. She left her&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:38:05.840 --> 01:38:07.680
career as a psychobiologist.
Tim Ferriss: Okay, all right.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:38:08.200 --> 01:38:10.920
This is non-trivial. Okay.
Apollo Robbins: It's huge. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:38:10.920 --> 01:38:15.320
studied mentalism after meeting Derren Brown. She&nbsp;
