book. It's a different thing to say,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:38:43.080 --> 01:38:47.920
"But where did this really come from? Where&nbsp;
did this idea really come from?" A certain&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:38:47.920 --> 01:38:52.360
type of pocket, or a certain type of thing.
And there were legends of people doing things&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:38:52.360 --> 01:38:57.400
in certain places. There's these group of&nbsp;
women called the 40 Elephants that used to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:38:57.400 --> 01:39:04.160
be in the UK. And around probably 1890 to the&nbsp;
1940s, they ran a criminal group there. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:39:04.160 --> 01:39:07.760
they could steal large amount of things&nbsp;
by altering their clothing, and doing a&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:39:07.760 --> 01:39:11.600
variation of what's called boosters or boosting.
