01:39:11.600 --> 01:39:16.520
like that. And who's the people that are doing it&nbsp;
now? There's a resurgence of footage showing up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:39:16.520 --> 01:39:20.800
now that YouTube is so pervasive with security&nbsp;
cameras, of women doing things that are like that.&nbsp;

01:39:20.800 --> 01:39:25.160
