flatscreen TV, and putting it underneath their&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:39:25.160 --> 01:39:31.200
dress, and walking without changing their&nbsp;
gait. Or taking 10-pound cases of beer or wine,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:39:31.200 --> 01:39:35.360
