turned into elements for other movies that are&nbsp;
cons and heist movies. I was very interested in,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:55:06.640 --> 01:55:11.480
because he was a language professor who&nbsp;
was studying the language of thieves.&nbsp;

01:55:11.480 --> 01:55:19.840
Whiz Mob was a specific type of theft. It's&nbsp;
not just a pickpocket on the street. The name&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:55:19.840 --> 01:55:25.720
of Whiz Mob is this idea that there are thieves&nbsp;
