other places that the cannons were around. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:55:44.840 --> 01:55:49.640
started to meet some people that were coming into&nbsp;
Louisville, Kentucky for I guess the Kentucky&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:55:49.640 --> 01:55:53.880
Derby for this event. He found that there were&nbsp;
groups of cannons that would find each other&nbsp;&nbsp;

