internationally and play as bigger teams.
They were fascinating. It was hard for&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:55:58.400 --> 01:56:02.760
surveillance to catch them because they could&nbsp;
change their composition as a team, change their&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:56:02.760 --> 01:56:10.800
tactics, and they had very different skill levels.&nbsp;
That lit a fire for me to try to find a cannon, to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:56:10.800 --> 01:56:17.840
try to find Whiz Mob. The New Yorker article that&nbsp;
