where I used to spend a lot of my time. That book,&nbsp;
Maurer's book, taught me to be a student of these&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:57:06.600 --> 01:57:11.920
arcane disciplines and see what I could learn.
Tim Ferriss: So a question on arcane discipline&nbsp;&nbsp;

