an American football team or basketball&nbsp;
team, probably are not familiar with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:57:24.920 --> 01:57:32.280
different roles that a cannon could take. So&nbsp;
what does a team of thieves look like? Or at&nbsp;&nbsp;

