01:57:57.200 --> 01:58:02.320
in what people would think is, oh, that's just&nbsp;
a diversion. It's more than that. As you move&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:58:02.320 --> 01:58:06.320
from country to country, there's different&nbsp;
approaches of how people steal in one country&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:58:06.320 --> 01:58:11.800
versus another. It tends to be that you see them&nbsp;
move like a school of fish through a crowd. So&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:58:11.800 --> 01:58:15.720
if somebody's in an event and they've locked&nbsp;
