01:58:15.720 --> 01:58:22.280
whether it's a casino or an event, you'll see&nbsp;
the thieves move with them as a school of fish.&nbsp;

01:58:23.240 --> 01:58:29.840
The roles with that, the wire is kind of&nbsp;
