that has — some of it's permeated into our&nbsp;
culture. It's a fascinating place. The steer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:02:25.840 --> 02:02:30.000
I think for me, when I'm looking for a team, I&nbsp;
often look for the steer. Either the steer or the&nbsp;&nbsp;

