that's automatically safe by the way, but for&nbsp;
argument's sake, you've tried to leave as much&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:07:05.720 --> 02:07:10.720
behind as possible. No cash. You're like, I'll&nbsp;
try to use Apple Pay. You've got your phone,&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:07:10.720 --> 02:07:15.224
where should you put it on your body? Some targets&nbsp;
I would imagine some are harder than others.&nbsp;

02:07:15.224 --> 02:07:19.560
Apollo Robbins: Yeah, they are. So your inside&nbsp;
jacket pocket. They used to think that that was&nbsp;&nbsp;

